@dc:title "Vinarcik Apollo GNC Vocabulary Bundle"
@dc:description "A packaging bundle that includes the Vinarcik Apollo GNC vocabulary."
vocabulary bundle <http://www.example.com/apollo-cm-gnc/method/bundle#> as method-bundle {
    includes <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    includes <http://www.example.com/apollo-cm-gnc/method/vocabulary#>
}
